<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Warframe 战甲</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; letter-spacing: 0; }
body { margin: 0; padding: 28px; background: #e3e7e5; color: #2b3e36; font: 14px/1.6 "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", sans-serif; }
main { max-width: 800px; margin: auto; background: #1d2822; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 28px 60px rgba(20,36,27,.3), 0 5px 14px rgba(20,36,27,.15); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.8); }
.hero { position: relative; min-height: 348px; color: white; overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 2px solid #c4b374; }
.backdrop { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.veil { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: rgba(13,24,20,.43); }
