COMMENT ON COLUMN nnmbot.wf_official_rebuild_marker.product_path IS '身份所属 Nnm JSON 路径';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nnmbot.wf_official_rebuild_marker.domain_code IS '官方业务领域代码';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nnmbot.wf_official_rebuild_marker.bkey IS '官方根对象稳定业务键';
COMMENT ON COLUMN nnmbot.wf_official_rebuild_marker.requested_at IS '登记待重建的时间';

